  "reviewer_note": "The battlefield is not firmly located: EBSCO says about 60 miles (97 km) southwest of Carthage near the village of Zama; the Catholic Encyclopedia places Zama Major at Djama. The pin is Siliana city (OSM), a reference point in that region and not named on the opened pages, hence 120 km uncertainty. The 19 October day is from the older Catholic Encyclopedia only.",
